<title>DUBAI: SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP ONE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP ONE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Cup Asian zone</p>
<p>group one qualifying matches played in Jeddah, Saudi Arabia, on</p>
<p>Monday:</p>
<p>Malaysia 1 Bangladesh 0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer:</p>
<p>Zain al-Abedine 32 pen</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia 6 Taiwan 0 (4-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Sami Gaber 3, 17, 63</p>
<p>Khaled Mas'ad 5</p>
<p>Abdel-Aziz al-Dhasiri 31</p>
<p>Khamees al-Zahrani 46</p>
<p>    Final standings     Pl   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia		6   5   1   0  18   1    16</p>
<p> Malaysia		    6   3   2   1   5   3    11</p>
<p> Taiwan			6   1   1   4   4  13     4</p>
<p> Bangladesh		  6   1   0   5   4  14     3</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia qualify for second round</p>
</text>
